WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.600
new day, right? Another day, how am I going to be if I have the same circumstance in my life,

00:00:05.600 --> 00:00:11.200
right? What's a better way for Raj to be or Joe to be the next day? Let me remind myself that I

00:00:11.200 --> 00:00:16.000
could be that way tomorrow. I promise you, if you're sincere, just for two, two, three weeks

00:00:16.000 --> 00:00:22.960
of doing that, you'll naturally surprise yourself like, wow, I really didn't react to that person.

00:00:22.960 --> 00:00:27.600
Wow. I noticed that I was way more calm. I noticed that the person that normally pushes

00:00:27.600 --> 00:00:31.920
my buttons. I didn't feel that. And that's one of the crazy things that happens

00:00:32.720 --> 00:00:36.720
from our community. They return back into their life. One of the common things people say is,

00:00:37.280 --> 00:00:42.560
but I return back into my life and people say, what happened to you? What did you do?

00:00:42.560 --> 00:00:46.480
Like, are you on a new drug? Are you taking a new medication? Did you get a face thing?

00:00:47.440 --> 00:00:51.280
You got a secret? You're not telling me? You look different, right? Because they are different,

00:00:51.280 --> 00:00:55.280
right?
